@startuml PR Validation Workflow - Line 368

title PR Validation Workflow\nFocus on Line 368: AI Test Optimizer Execute

actor Developer as Dev
participant "GitHub Actions" as GH
participant "Git" as Git
participant "AI Test Optimizer" as AI
participant "Express Server" as Server
participant "Test Suite" as Tests

Dev -> GH: Creates/Updates Pull Request
activate GH

== Setup Phase ==
GH -> Git: Checkout PR code
GH -> GH: Install dependencies\n& Playwright browsers
GH -> GH: Build server + client

== Server Start ==
GH -> Server: Start server (port 3000)
activate Server
loop Health Check (15 attempts)
    GH -> Server: GET /api/health
    Server --> GH: Response
end
Server --> GH: ✅ Server ready

== Change Analysis ==
GH -> Git: git diff base..head\n--name-only
Git --> GH: CHANGED_FILES

alt Auth files changed
    
    note over GH: 🔐 Priority: Auth Tests
    
    GH -> AI: optimize balanced
    AI --> GH: Optimization plan
    
    GH -> Tests: npm run test:auth
    activate Tests
    Tests --> GH: Auth test results
    deactivate Tests
    
    alt Auth tests PASS
        note over GH,AI: **LINE 368: Execute AI Optimizer**
        GH -> AI: ts-node execute
        activate AI
        
        AI -> AI: Load optimization plan
        AI -> AI: Select additional tests
        AI -> Tests: Execute selected tests
        activate Tests
        Tests --> AI: Test results
        deactivate Tests
        
        AI --> GH: ✅ Completed
        deactivate AI
        
    else Auth tests FAIL
        note over GH: ⚠️ Stop with summary
        GH --> Dev: ❌ Fix required
    end
    
else No auth changes
    
    note over GH,AI: **LINE 368: Direct Execution**
    
    GH -> AI: optimize balanced
    AI --> GH: Plan generated
    
    GH -> AI: ts-node execute
    activate AI
    
    AI -> AI: Analyze PR changes
    AI -> AI: Calculate priorities
    AI -> Tests: Execute optimized tests
    activate Tests
    Tests --> AI: Results
    deactivate Tests
    
    alt Tests PASS
        AI --> GH: ✅ Success
        deactivate AI
    else Tests FAIL
        AI --> GH: ⚠️ Fallback
        deactivate AI
        
        GH -> Tests: npm run test:smoke
        activate Tests
        Tests --> GH: Smoke results
        deactivate Tests
    end
end

== Cleanup ==
GH -> Server: Kill server process
deactivate Server
GH -> GH: Clean temp files

GH --> Dev: 📊 Final report
deactivate GH

@enduml
